Hey Tribe! Today we have our pre-release update, and there are changes you can find in it:
* 3 new achievements;
* First level on the map is easier now, so you can earn tokens and learn encounters on it;
* some encounters generation changes;
* Levels description on map;
* Behavior of desert rabbit is slightly changed, and some bugs about desert birds are fixed;
* Other bugfix all over the game;
That's all for today, have a good run!

