Hey folks!
In this update the next stuff happens:
* New usage of tokens - you can hunt between the level, bring more people to the tribe or even restart the level without losing progress when your tribe is dead;
* You can play single runs whenever you want now - even between the runs in the Big Pass. Handy if you want to make a high score;
* You can play next Big Pass right after you finished previous - no need to play single run again;
* For experienced players - now the shaman goes in the group which is closest to your mouse click position;
* More useful tips while level loading;
That's all for today, stay tuned and have a good run!

