Hey, Tribe! Today we made few improvements:
* A lot of new stuff about the bushes;
* Passing the night is more expensive now;
* Eating your people isn't so profitable as it was;
* Food-on-People exchange is more expensive if your tribe has more than 20 tribesmen;
* Exterminator's mask penalty has been changed;
* Tiger's logic has been changed;
* Text events are less common on the map (The Tik's Cave has been removed from rotation);
* Small fixes with UI;

In our future updates:
* Leaderboard with the result of the Real run;
* Real run's result UI improvement;
* Changes in the balance of food accumulation and consumption;
* Changes of the Masks bonuses and penalties;

Have a good run! 
The Tribe Tea(m)

